steps.quote:
Any other edits will be done with one or more of the following steps:
Erasing voxels;
Filling voxels;
Adding control points;
Cloning voxels.

checks.quote:
Soft failures can be divided into the following categories:
Skullstripping errors;
Pial surface errors;
Intensity normalization errors;
Topological defects; and
White matter segmentation errors.

